    "description": "Item Description\nOverview:\nUp for auction is a beautiful vintage sterling silver footed bowl (compote dish) featuring a classic mid-century design. The bowl is accented with an elegant gadroon (rope-style) border around the rim and sits on a sturdy pedestal base. It displays a wonderfully aged patina that highlights its classic form.\nSpecifications:\nComposition: Genuine Sterling Silver (.925 Purity)\nBase: Weighted (Stamped for stability)\nDesign Elements: Flared pedestal base, deep polished basin, textured gadroon rim accent\nMarkings: Clearly stamped \"Sterling Weighted\" on the underside of the base.\nCondition:\nThe piece is in good vintage condition with no major dents or warping. It exhibits an authentic, heavy dark tarnish/patina. We have left it unpolished to preserve its vintage character, but it should polish up beautifully to a bright mirror shine if the winning bidder prefers. Please review all photos carefully as they serve as the primary description of condition.",
